    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You are the perfect predator — invisible, precise, and lethal. All tech powers have their action cost <strong>reduced by 1</strong> (minimum 1 action) and you retain all prior mastery bonuses. On a turn you use Tactical Cloak, you have <strong>resistance 5</strong> to all damage until the start of your next turn, whether or not a Strike has ended the cloak. Tech powers you use while cloaked have their DC increased by <strong>2</strong>.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Improved Infiltrator Mastery.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The resistance applies while the Tactical Cloak effect is on you and, after a Strike ends the cloak, while the Cloak Wake effect that replaces it lasts. The +2 is added to your class DC while the Tactical Cloak effect is on you.</em></p>"
    },
